---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { ShieldCheck, Lock, Eye, FileText } from 'lucide-astro';

const lastUpdated = "September 14, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | TheCyberDefender" description="Privacy policy and data protection standards of TheCyberDefender.live">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">
    <!-- Page Badge & Heading -->
    <div class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-cyan-500/15">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#00E5FF] font-bold uppercase mb-3 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30">
        <Lock class="w-3 h-3" />
        LEGAL ARCHITECTURE
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mt-2">Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      <section class="rounded-2xl bg-[#070E1B] border border-cyan-500/20 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" />
          1. Overview
        </h2>
        <p>
          At TheCyberDefender (reachable at thecyberdefender.live), protecting user privacy is integral to our security mission. This Privacy Policy details the types of information gathered, logged, and utilized when accessing our technical publications, guides, and security tool listings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl bg-[#070E1B] border border-cyan-500/20 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <Eye class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" />
          2. Data Collection & Analytics
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          We practice data minimization. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal identification data. We collect minimal telemetry strictly needed for website functionality:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-400 text-xs font-mono">
          <li>Server access logs (IP addresses, request headers, user agent, timestamps).</li>
          <li>Privacy-focused web performance metrics to detect DDoS and unauthorized bot traffic.</li>
          <li>Email addresses submitted strictly via voluntary newsletter subscriptions or contact inquiries.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl bg-[#070E1B] border border-cyan-500/20 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <FileText class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" />
          3. External Security Tools & Third-Party Links
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our platform features guides and links directing to external software, GitHub repositories, and cybersecurity vendor portals. TheCyberDefender carries no jurisdiction over the logging habits, privacy configurations, or security postures of third-party domains.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl bg-[#070E1B] border border-cyan-500/20 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <Lock class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" />
          4. Contact & Disclosures
        </h2>
        <p>
          For inquiries regarding data privacy or responsible vulnerability disclosure, transmit an email to <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono">hello@thecyberdefender.com</span>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>